comments.body:
lora is the best. trains the the same weights as dreambooth but you can control the amount of cat litter with net dim. also converges on 2k steps, and 2k steps on 10 gb vram is like 6 minutes. so you just train many many loras in one script and then check which is better.

&#x200B;

good guides [https://rentry.org/59xed3](https://rentry.org/59xed3) and [https://rentry.org/lora-training-science](https://rentry.org/lora-training-science)
